  "notes": "Complete official Apache-2.0 PAL TIAGo (PMB2, 7-axis arm, torso, independent parallel fingers, pan/tilt head). Original mechanics and source public-simulation fixed low-friction casters; declared bounded lab servo/sensor adapters. Drive and Mobile arm use existing command leases, Stop, measured feedback and mutual inhibition. Source antenna/tool inertias are degenerate; backend importer regularization and rest-contact exclusions are declared, not faithful-dynamics qualification. MuJoCo/PyBullet/Isaac experimental adapter; no physical mission certificate. Retained Display control screens and exact measured scope: docs/status/evidence/tiago-2026-11-14/README.md. Gazebo Fortress source port, camera/object pipelines, payload/costmap integration and wider missions remain pending."
